---
description: Commit message format for this repository
alwaysApply: true
---

Do not use `CN-*` prefixes in commit messages.

Use conventional prefixes:

- `feat:` — new capability
- `fix:` — bug fix (not `bugfix:`)
- `docs:` — documentation only
- `chore:` — tooling, deps, repo maintenance
- `refactor:` — behavior-preserving code change

Example: `feat: add nanovm-run dispatcher for QEMU guests`
